### GET all products
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products
Accept: application/json

### GET all orders
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### POST create order
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    {
      "id": "6821a470-071b-4cf4-b993-43cc8b2a8827",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### GET order by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/6821a470-071b-4cf4-b993-43cc8b2a8827
Accept: application/json

### PUT update order
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/orders/6821a470-071b-4cf4-b993-43cc8b2a8827
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "products": [
    {
      "id": "6821a470-071b-4cf4-b993-43cc8b2a8827",
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ]
}
